/* Recipe. Fetch the chunk off `hash.game/modules/account/assets/<name>.js` (the manifest at
 * `bc.game/bc.game/modules/account/assets/manifest-zssWG_dx.js` maps every expose to its file),
 * pull each `<svg viewBox="0 0 32 32">…</svg>` template out of the minified source, and convert
 * the attributes to JSX: `fill-rule` -> `fillRule`, `clip-rule` -> `clipRule`, and close every
 * `<path>` — Solid's templates leave them open, which JSX rejects. Two traps this project has
 * already documented and which are real here: strip any `<clipPath>` whose path equals the
 * viewBox (none of these twenty-two carries one), and keep prose out of the markup, since these
 * ship inline on every page load.
 *
 * `IconLight-BQc6-mqu.js` is the only chunk holding two: the moon first, then the sun. */
